# Cease: "Exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard." Bot2's graveyard holds two Lightning Bolts and Bot1's
# holds one. With Bot2's first Bolt chosen as the first card, the second card may not be Bot1's Bolt (a different graveyard,
# CR 115.1 read with the card's words) and may not be that same Bolt again (CR 115.3); Bot2's other Bolt is the positive
# control, the same choice from the same graveyard. Only Bot2's two Bolts are exiled; Bot1's stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mountain
Swamp
Lightning Bolt
Cease // Desist
Forest
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
